lish.)\" [472]\u3000\u3000\"I don't know, I've just heard the name. It's a mystery novel, right?\" Xianchuan took a sip of beer. He realized that his mind was a bit fuzzy. He had no resistance to alcohol at all. [473]\u3000\u3000\"That's right, it's the best mystery novel by a guy named Mengyao Chuozu. It's an old work\u2026\" Menghui explained, \"It talks about people being bewitched by foxes. When someone is guarding a corpse at night, the corpse goes out into the yard and causes trouble\u2026 Actually, it's the guard who unconsciously plays with the corpse, like playing with a doll. That is, they think the corpse is moving, but it's actually their own hands moving.\" [474]\u3000\u3000\"Wait, I don't quite understand what you're saying.\" Xianchuan said, his face flushed. \"Why would a living person play with a dead body? What's the point?\" [475]\u3000\u3000\"This, maybe because of excessive fatigue\u2026 like sleepwalking.\" Menghui tilted her head. \"I can't remember too clearly, and it's a bit hard to believe\u2026 Anyway, it's about playing with the corpse and only remembering that the corpse is moving, like playing with a doll\u2026 Yeah, do you understand what I mean?\" [476] \"Because Dr. Akira said the killer was a doll, I remembered.\" Momo said, taking a sip from the can, \"Dr. Akira said she saw a doll kill her parents. In reality, she was that doll, and her consciousness left her body and saw... \"\n[477] \"Interesting... but the facts can't be changed.\" Nishikawa took another sip of beer, he could only drink one can at most, \"Regardless of the consciousness, Dr. Akira's act of killing cannot be changed. There were witnesses, and the trial has ended. It's been fifteen years ago. I'm not interested in that. I'm more interested in what happened to her afterwards. Isolated from society for fifteen years. I really want to see her... \"\n[478] \"Here you go, Nishikawa.\" The graduate student, Hida, walked over with a plate of meat and vegetables and chop