s long as there's an internet connection, she could be anywhere. Even a tea room with a keyboard...\"\n[3798] \"But her face appeared on the screen too...\" Shibuchi said hurriedly. [3799] \"That could be a recording... She probably recorded the data on the workstation beforehand. She completely escaped... There's no point in looking for her in the research center or on the island.\" [3800] \"When you were playing VR car racing, was it done remotely on a computer?\" Hanae asked. [3801] \"Yes\u2026 You can operate from anywhere.\" Nakagawa answered. [3802] \"But she also sent her voice, so it must have been from a workstation somewhere.\" Mitani said, \"It's probably not a university's computer center\u2026 Anyone can go in there, can't they?\" [3803] \"The voice could have been sent over the phone and a simulated computer.\" Mizuhara stroked his chin, \"Using one of the institute's machines as the main host\u2026 Controlling it over the phone and the internet\u2026\"\n[3804] \"Why did Shinobu Futaba run away?\" The head of the department, Nishiyama, asked in a low voice. [3805] \"Because she's the murderer.\" Nakagawa answered, \"She's the one who killed three people. No, all of this was her doing. Detective-san, you should contact your department right away. It's already too late\u2026\"\n[3806] The Shimizu nodded, wide-eyed. [3807] \"Genius... a genius,\" said Sugawara, nodding repeatedly. \"She won't be swayed by our ideas... she's been ahead from the start...\"\n[3808] \"But Future-san only speaks English, doesn't she?\" asked the head of the West Garden. [3809] \"She's a genius...\" Sugawara smiled. Then, he blew smoke rings with the cigarette in his hand. [3810] \"She's Dr. Akira Miyuki.\" [3811] 8\n[3812] Zuo Chi and Shiyuzhuang said \"We'll be right back\" and left the room. After that, no one in the chief's office spoke. [3813] Xucun remembered it was summer. [3814] The university was on summer vacation. Of course, even though it was summer vacation, it only meant there were no classes. Generally, scholars like Xucun, who are research-oriented, don't even realize it's summer vacation, let alone Obon. Xucun's research lab had windows, but it was basically the same as the True Ardor Research Institute. [3815] He smoked, thinking about what he would think about when he returned to the university. The murder case had ended. At least, Xucun's interest in this case had quickly disappeared. [3816] Detective Shimizu picked up the helicopter model on the chief's desk. [3817] \"The helicopter was invented by Leonardo da Vinci,\" Detective Shimizu said to himself, \"before the airplane. It's strange that it took humans so long to realize the principles of flight... At one point, they thought that birds flapping their wings pushed air downward... That was the reason for the failure...\"\n[3818] No one paid attention to Detective Shimizu's words, except for Yoshiko, who chuckled quietly in the corner. Miyuki seemed a little worried and approached Detective Shimizu. [3819] \"Teacher...\" Miyuki said, \"You said that Dr. Shinjiro Ardor was the murderer...\"\n[3820] \"Yes,\" Detective Shimizu put the helicopter model back on the table and exhaled smoke from one hand. \"I'm not an expert in this field, so I don't know the specifics of multiple personalities... No, I mean, what's physically going on. But, originally, there are multiple personalities within one individual, right? Some people might not believe it, but at least for me... I have many different personalities. I personally believe that very few people have a single personality...\"\n[3821] There was still no reaction from everyone to Xiangchuan's words. [3822] Xiangchuan turned around and spoke to everyone. [3823] \"I mentioned that Japan is a liquid society and the West is a solid society, and this can also be applied to individuals... The Japanese, their multiple personalities within their bodies are like liquids mixed together and stirred. The West's thoughts are not like