ng Seijin left the room. [221] Momo drew stood there looking at the closed door for a while. She felt that in the end, she didn't really connect with Yichi and Shenzhu. [222] What is an intelligence game? [223] M\u00e9nghu\u00ec put her and X\u012bchu\u0101n's coffee cups in the cabinet after washing them. There was still half of the coffee left in X\u012bchu\u0101n's cup, but she poured it out. From this action, she realized her own dissatisfaction. [224] She left the room and headed to the graduate student room on the third floor where Noguchi is. Why didn't she tell Yoshiko that Noguchi is on the floor below? While pondering, Miyuki went downstairs. [225]5\n[226] \"Above all, don't use unknown floppy disks,\" Aoyama explained to Kuroda. \"Don't bring games to play...\n[227] Four of the six Apple computers in the graduate student room were infected with viruses. A virus scan revealed that it was a virus that was popular five years ago in France. However, the files that were severely damaged were not many. Fortunately, Kuroda noticed something was wrong with his computer early on. The virus was mostly handled. [228] \"And be careful when downloading software from the internet,\" Aoyama said as he pulled out the floppy disk. \"It's safest not to download anything. Buy the software you need instead.\" [229] \"I'm sorry, teacher,\" Kuroda said sheepishly. It turned out that he had copied the game from another class about three days ago. [230] Fuyu entered the graduate student room. The messy graduate student room had only Aoyama and Kuroda in it. [231] \"Teacher, someone has come to see you.\" Xi Zhongyun approached the two of them. [232] \"Who?\" Shuzhi asked while looking at the screen. Bin Zhong stood behind Shuzhi. [233] \"A person named Yisong Shijin.\" Xi Zhongyun reported in a formal manner, \"She came and went quickly, and brought gifts... It seems to be cheap snacks...\"\n[234] \"Is that so...\" Shuzhi's expression changed little, \"Bin Zhong, have you copied