e students' location, they noticed that everyone was slightly lowering their heads. There was a dilapidated waiting room at the terminal, and there were hardly any people sitting on the benches. There were two old-fashioned vending machines. There were eight students in total. [328] \"Is Inukai-san not coming?\" Kurosu asked, looking at everyone's faces. He checked his watch and realized that there were about fifteen minutes until departure. [329] \"She's not taking a helicopter, is she?\" Graduate student Hatake sipped his juice and said, \"That girl won't come to such a shabby place.\" [330] The number of backpacks containing camping equipment was quite large, as well as three days' worth of water and food. [331] \"Ah, she's here,\" Hinata looked in the direction of the upstream embankment. [332] A black car passed the bridge and drove onto the embankment, heading towards them. The car didn't enter the parking lot but continued down the slope along the ferry terminal. It turned out to be a deep brown Jaguar.\n <Assistant> I have read the book and I will answer the question you ask.\n\nPassage 8:\nDialogue between User and Assistant 2026-06-12 03:47:35 \\n<User> The following context is the book I have read: \nThis should also be preserved in the source list... During that minute, Dr. Akutagawa came out from the yellow door and took the elevator.\" [3875] \"First of all... Dr. Akagi took the elevator up to the director's office on the first floor. That's where we are now.\" Nukari walked to the corner of the room and then turned around to come back. [3876] \"Here? The director's room? Why come here?\" Momo-chan asked. [3877] \"At that time, Director Nitou sent an email saying that he was bringing Dr. Akagi Future-san with him. It was sent from this terminal by Dr. Akagi.\" Saito replied expressionlessly, \"To give everyone the impression that Director Nitou was about to bring Future-san back\u2026 impressions, preconceptions\u2026 people's judgments are often dominated by these\u2026\"\n[3878] \"It took no more than a minute to do this. After sending the email, Dr. Akagi immediately went to the roof. The door to the roof was open. The white door on the roof was just like the yellow door, both of them were opened as programmed. Instead of putting up the right hand and reporting the name before opening, because it was not working according to Deborah's usual program, it was not recorded. Everything was set up in the system, it was decided seven years ago.\" [3879] Saito walked towards Momo-chan. He looked at Momo-chan and whispered, \"At that time, Dr. Akagi walked out of the room for the first time in fifteen years\u2026 That hot summer night must have been very familiar to her. She recalled summer\u2026 She looked up at the starry sky that was exactly the same as fifteen years ago. Listening to the sound of insects\u2026 How did Dr. Akagi feel during the time when the director's helicopter came? Actually, this is the place I am most interested in\u2026\"\n[3880] Saito lit another cigarette and walked slowly. [3881] \"To get back to the point... Chief New Vine finally arrived in the helicopter... As soon as the helicopter landed, Dr. Akiko Hikari jumped into the helicopter and stabbed Chief New Vine with a knife she brought from her room. The wireless communicator was destroyed at that time.\" [3882] \"Hmm?\" Mio exclaims, \"But I and Mr. Yamanaka were still with New Vine Chief...\"\n[3883]\"But that's the truth, West Garden...\" Kurosu looks down and walks on the \"day\" - shaped carpet \"Dr. Akiko Hikari stubbed the child with a knife. But the child didn't die immediately... At that time, Mr. Yamanaka and Ms. West Garden camera. And Mr. Mochizuki. Chief New Vine was Severely Wounded. However, he tried to hide his injuries and acted as if nothing had happened. Because it was inside the helicopter, it could not be seen\" \"en from the outside... Then, Dr. Akiko Hikari camera out of the helicopter. Yes, as Miss Akiko Hikari...\